OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA partly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with isolated,
OL,7,Fpotentially heavy and thundery,
OL,8,Fshowers in the north. A dry night for
OL,9,Fmost but isolated showers continue for
OL,10,Fthe west and south coast. Cool.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA partly cloudy start with
OL,13,Fisolated showers. Showers becoming
OL,14,Fmore widespread through the afternoon
OL,15,Fand turning heavy and thundery in
OL,16,Fplaces, slowly easing later. Near
OL,17,Faverage temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
